      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "IT'S A TEASE (1) has a strong record this track and trip including two wins from four starts. Below best last time at The Gardens (29.95) in a Grade 4/5, finishing a 6 length fourth. Rates a leading player. DESPICABLE KYRO (6) impressed when posting an exceptional 22.23 over 400m at this track three back then has hit the frame in both runs since. Must include on winning run three back. ZIPPING GRESSIER (2) struggled in tougher grade last start after losing his position early at The Gardens, but prior to that won by 2.75 lengths at The Gardens (23.04) beating Daphne Zacapa in a Grade 5 on October 17. Can figure in the finish.",
